{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last thing Sam expected during his final summer before college was to end up staying at Michael\u2019s house, his mom\u2019s ex-husband. A man he hadn\u2019t seen in over ten years and didn\u2019t have the fondest memories of. What was meant to be a short stay quickly becomes something far more complicated, when old resentment meets unexpected curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Sam meets new people and struggles with unfamiliar thoughts, one thing becomes clear: this trip isn\u2019t just about getting by, it\u2019s about discovering what he really desires.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEET HOT GUYS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of hot men who gradually awaken Sam\u2019s imagination and desires, each with their own charm and personality. Enjoy playful banter, naughty fantasies and intense moments of intimacy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103530/extras/7347bf6b4b8488c2599ec4f3074ccfef.poster.avif?t=1771867645\" width=1170 height=499 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103530/extras/7347bf6b4b8488c2599ec4f3074ccfef.webm?t=1771867645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAKE CHOICES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make choices that shape Sam\u2019s experiences, conversations, and the moments you see along the way. Your decisions influence how his story unfolds, revealing different sides of the people he meets.  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103530/extras/7ff79c85aa3eab9379d